s=\"header\">\n            <div class=\"status-badge\">{{ $json.body.success ? \"Success\" : \"Failed\" }}</div>\n            <h2 style=\"margin: 10px 0 0 0;\">视频生成任务报告</h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"content\">\n            <div class=\"section-title\">基本信息</div>\n            <div class=\"data-row\">\n                <span class=\"data-label\">任务 ID</span>\n                <span class=\"data-value\">{{ $json.body.taskId }}</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"data-row\">\n                <span class=\"data-label\">创建时间</span>\n                <span class=\"data-value\">{{ $json.body.createdAt }}</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top: 24px;\">性能与输出</div>\n            <div class=\"data-row\">\n                <span class=\"data-label\">渲染耗时 (Render Duration)</span>\n                <span class=\"data-value\" style=\"color: #d93025;\">{{ $json.body.duration }}s</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"data-row\">\n                <span class=\"data-label\">输出文件</span>\n                <a href=\"{{ $json.body.videoUrl }}\" class=\"data-value\" style=\"color: #1a73e8; text-decoration: underline;\">查看生成的视频</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;\">\n                <a href=\"{{ $json.body.videoUrl }}\" class=\"link-btn\">立即预览视频成果</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"footer\">\n            <p>本报告由自动化渲染引擎生成</p>\n            <p>© 2026 自动化系统 · 自动发送请勿直接回复</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
